DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART:20261024T115900Z
DTEND:20261024T125900Z
SUMMARY:[Biometrics & Human Sensing][Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition]
  FG 2027 - Extended main and special-session abstract deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: IEEE International Conference on Automatic Fa
 ce and Gesture Recognition\nWebsite: https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/\
 nSource URL: https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/dates/\nLocation: Marrake
 sh\, Morocco\nTopics: Biometrics & Human Sensing\, Computer Vision & Patt
 ern Recognition\, Deep Representation Learning\, Machine Learning\nSize: 
 M\nSubmission type: Long and short papers / face\, gesture\, and body rec
 ognition\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-30\nNotes: Of
 ficial CFP and dates pages\, rechecked 2026-10-30\, keep the abstract and
  paper deadlines extended to October 23 and 30 (from October 9 and 16)\; 
 cutoffs are AoE. Workshop and tutorial proposals were extended from Octob
 er 20 to November 14\, with notification moved to November 18. The full e
 vent includes April 26/30 workshops\; main sessions are April 27-29. Demo
  (January 4)\, Doctoral Consortium (February 15) and competition steps ar
 e not tracked. CMT opening was announced for September 25 without an exac
 t hour\; no portal-open observation is fabricated. M is an editorial esti
 mate.\nScope: Face\, gesture\, body movement\, and human behavior from im
 ages and video\, including detection\, tracking\, recognition\, facial ex
 pression and affect\, pose and action analysis\, and soft biometrics. Cha
 racteristic methods include advanced visual learning\, generative modelin
 g and neural rendering\, multimodal fusion\, and evaluation across demogr
 aphic and acquisition conditions. Bias\, interpretability\, and robust re
 cognition are directly tied to human sensing rather than generic applicat
 ion tags.\nAdditional topics: Robustness & Safety\, Fairness & Responsibl
 e AI\, Computer Graphics & Visualization\, Explainability & Interpretabil
 ity\nScope sources (2027): https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/call-for-pa
 pers/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/dates/
END:VEVENT
